  "highlights": [
    "First-time players can create permanent secured accounts",
    "Host final leaderboard highlights the top three",
    "Player final screen shows personal and complete results",
    "Permanent player accounts and report-ready history approved",
    "Authenticated players see their profile instead of the hidden sign-in form",
    "Players can recover a forgotten password by email",
    "Player login errors provide accessible field feedback without exposing account details",
    "Signed-in players can change their username while keeping their permanent email identity",
    "Signed-in players can choose a predefined avatar for their profile",
    "Signed-in players can upload a personal photo as their avatar",
    "Player profile actions remain compact and usable on mobile screens",
    "Players must sign in before joining a game, with each participant linked to their permanent account",
    "Reconnect restores the same signed-in player's participant without any reusable credential in the browser",
    "Hosts can atomically import validated question CSV files with stable-ID updates and an auditable SHA-256 summary",
    "Hosts can load and select multiple active question categories from SQLite",
    "Player controllers display full answer text and preserve the selected answer after submission and reconnect"
  ],
